{"id":2964,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>暖阳铺展赛场，运动焕发风采。5月23日，中北大学2026年教职工运动会成功举办。我院教职工在赛场上尽显昂扬向上、团结奋进的精神底色，最终获得团体比赛第七名和体育道德风尚奖。</p><p>开幕式现场气势昂扬，各方阵迈着整齐步伐依次入场。我院教职工代表队精神抖擞、口号嘹亮，尽显为师者敬业担当与蓬勃朝气。在袋鼠搬家、齐心协力、滚滚向前等项目中，队员们默契配合、并肩作战；在投篮、飞镖、竞速等个人比赛中，大家沉着应战、全力冲刺，每一幕拼搏瞬间都彰显着竞技魅力。</p><p>赛场逐梦，不负韶华。以热爱为帆、以奋进为桨，步履不停、逐光前行。此次教职工运动会圆满结束，我院教职工将把赛场上凝聚的干劲、淬炼的意志融入到教学科研中，立足沃土深耕实干，在奋进征途上续写信通崭新华章。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Eo7-esLNnVU4WVMymA7nzGYM4n7nmMh7MRLZUzl8UmLDMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPoShfM1ybLzM2M7-solMVMR9YMNUsnzWfL4A7L4Q7nmAFU8C4L8-4MRfFMz-4nz-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLRLbgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18039&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A19A6913F4B79CE4826D7E2A38D36DF8/CF33B340/523E2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnR-ebMl7PolUaLyzlZLmUZLlQVoRlhiLRUZUNL8nRCDUz-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyPnSyDn1y8LNr7LR9sozliMz9DMmGbUmUDU4fVMRQVLzfFUmV2nzffMzMFLzLaLRUYgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRG4oSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18039&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EL8CePnz6RnzCYUy4QRMRGsUmA2LN-hPLN-inRLDM7CsUm70gihFp2hmCIa0n1h7nSyPn1hRMz9sUmN8UN7bLzA2LlC8MmCiM8Q2UmvbnznFUz6RMln2nNMFMmTkozvJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLRLbgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18039&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FDE1FC587B94BA918F1F46657FFB79E4/A7C5DFFC/69B97\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EL8CePnz6RnzCYUy4QRMRGsUmA2LN-hPLN-inRLDM7CsUm70gihFp2hmCIa0n1h7nSyPn1hRMz9sUmN8UN7bLzA2LlC8MmCiM8Q2UmvbnznFUz6RMln2nNMFMmTkozvJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLRLbgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18039&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Enz9eao7-8MmV2MyRGPLRNsn7CDU4ThkMzCsLmCsU4CinR90gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7UYyiL1yaMRGiLR7aMmGsnRV2Mm-DLR7ZUmGPLR9ZLRWFMRrVUz9inmQFMNUYLNCJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLRLbgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18039&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7DC520405010607D1F626018B0108802/45EA8